    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Substantial well laid out C. 130 M² 4 Bedroom and 2 Bathroom Detached House set in a popular location just off Arklow’s Lower Main Street.   With flexible accommodation, OFCH & attached Garage.  Pending application, this property may qualify for the Vacant Home Refurbishment Grant."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "FLOOR ACCOMMODATION GROUND \r\nENTRANCE HALLWAY\t - (1.96M X 1.01M)\t\t\t \r\nWith tiled floor and under stairs storage.\r\n\r\nWC - (1.12M X 1.81M)\r\nWith white suite wc & whb.  Wall shelving.\r\n\r\nSITTING ROOM - (6.08M X 3.66M)\t \t\t\r\nLarge room running from front to back of house with timber and tiled open fireplace.  Door through to Living\r\nRoom.\r\n\r\nLIVING ROOM - (3.029M X 6.509M)\t\t\r\nLocated to the rear of the property with carpeted flooring.  This room would be highly suitable for a home \r\nOffice or Study.\r\n\r\nDINING ROOM – (4.85M X 2.80M)\r\nWith laminate flooring and built in wall cabinet.\r\n\r\nKITCHEN/DINING ROOM - (2.70M X 3.83M)\t\t\t\r\nWith built in timber fitted kitchen with integrated electric hob and sink unit. Laminate flooring and access\r\nthrough to the attached garage.   Door through to the rear garden.\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR ACCOMMODATION\r\n\r\nLANDING - (4.32M X 0.89M )\r\nWith carpeted flooring.  Location of hot press and attic access.\t\t\t\t \t\t \r\n\r\nMAIN BATHROOM  - \t(2.75M X 1.81M + 0.44M X 0.74)\t\t\t\r\nWith coloured suite wc, whb and bath. Built in shower unit (Triton T90xr), fully tiled.  Laminate flooring, half\r\ntiled walls and mirror over sink.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 1 - (2.74M X 4.17M)\r\nLocated to the rear of the property with carpeted flooring.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 2 - (3.26M X 3.03M)\r\nLocated to the rear of the property, with carpeted flooring & wall shelving.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 3 - (3.66M X 2.73M)\r\nLocated to the rear with carpeted flooring and built in storage press.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 4 - (2.71M X 2.62M + 1.08M X 1.96)\r\nLocated to the front with carpeted flooring and built in storage press.\r\n\r\nATTACHED GARAGE (2.76M X 2.78M)\r\n\r\nGARDENS\r\nPaved and concreted front garden with timber gated side entrances, either side of house.  Garage access from the front and off street and on street parking at the front of the house also.  Rear garden partly paved and in lawn with block wall boundaries.   Boiler House C. 1.7 M²\r\n\r\nSERVICES\r\nESB, Water & Sewerage are all on mains supply.\r\nWindows & Doors – hardwood single glazed windows and hardwood front and back doors.\r\nHeating System – OFCH\r\nBER G –  (BER Number: 119759306) \r\n\r\nGENERAL\r\nSubstantial detached home set in an extremely convenient location, fronting onto the open green area between Abbey Park and Rory O’Connors Place.  Abbey Park is located just a short walk away from Arklow’s Lower Main\r\nStreet, Train Station, The Harbour and South Beach.  This is a generously sized well built and well laid out family \r\nhome which offers flexible accommodation.  The property would benefit from upgrading and as the property has been vacant for over two years, pending application the property may qualify for the Vacant Home Refurbishment Grant.   Links to Grant Information:-  seai.ie/grants/home-energy-grants or gov.ie/en/service/f8f1b-vacant-property-refurbishment-grant/\r\nThis lovely home offers any discerning purchaser the opportunity to transform and create a family home tailored to their own style and specification.  It is truly an exciting blank canvass."
      },
